main.gti:8:3: error[GTI-S2017]: Cannot use a parent loan while an overlapping child reborrow may still be live.
 8 |   parent = 3;  //~ ERROR GTI-S2017
   |   ^~~~~~
main.gti:7:20: note: Retained borrow originates here.
 7 |   mut int& child = parent;
   |                    ^~~~~~
main.gti:9:3: note: The borrowed value is used later here.
 9 |   return child;
   |   ^~~~~~~~~~~~~
help: Finish using the borrowed value before changing or moving its owner, or perform the owner operation before creating the borrow. Choose an order that preserves the intended effects.
